---
title: "Order lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: order placed
  Pending --> Paid: payment captured
  Pending --> Cancelled: declined or<br/>hold expired
  Paid --> Fulfilling: picked
  Paid --> Refunded: cancelled<br/>before picking
  Fulfilling --> Shipped: label printed
  Shipped --> Delivered: carrier scan
  Delivered --> Refunded: return received
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Delivered --> [*]
  Refunded --> [*]
